{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents27OUDSLinearProgressIndicatorV","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS"},{"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS"},{"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"introducedAt":"11.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator"}],"role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"Variants","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Variants"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two variants are provided:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}]},{"text":": the caller provides a ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value in ","type":"text"},{"code":"[0, 1]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Values outside this range are coerced.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reducing uncertainty.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the progress value is known (file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"completion time or percentage.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the interface is frozen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Statuses","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Statuses"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loading, processing, synchronization or background tasks.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"onboarding)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Positive","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retrieval)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"monitored."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Negative","type":"text"}]},{"text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Gap-size","text":"Gap size","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"text":": standard gap between the bar and the track (base Android Material 3 specification).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Track","text":"Track","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a clear structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Stop indicator (determinate only)","anchor":"Stop-indicator-determinate-only"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default): no stop indicator is drawn.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": a small square (or dot if the theme uses rounded caps) is drawn at the end of the track to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identify the end of the range easily. Required by accessibility criteria when the track has a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contrast below 3:1 with its container or the surface behind the container.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The stop indicator is only available on the determinate variant, matching the Android Material 3","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specification: the indeterminate variant has no meaningful end position for it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Helper text","anchor":"Helper-text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional text displayed below the progress bar to provide context or additional information.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" which offers two variants:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"text":" parameter controls horizontal alignment (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".percent(description:alignment:)"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The percentage value and its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value"},{"text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75%\""},{"text":" in English, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75 %\""},{"text":" in French, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"٪75\""},{"text":" in Arabic).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"},{"text":" (default), only the percentage is shown, centered.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"alignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":".start","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the percentage is at the leading edge and the description (if provided) at the trailing edge.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"type":"text","text":", the description (if provided) is at the leading edge and the percentage at the trailing edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"text":" mode, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" parameter is a simple ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"text":" with a separate ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperTextAlignment"},{"text":" parameter:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"}]},{"text":" (default): The text is centered under the progress bar.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The text is aligned to the leading edge."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": The text is aligned to the trailing edge."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Animation","level":2,"anchor":"Animation","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": when ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default), the indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the target ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on first display and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(based on Android Material 3 specifications). When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"text":": the Android Material 3 two-line animation is intrinsic to the mode and cannot be disabled from the call site; there is no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter on the indeterminate initializer."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are always disabled and a static bar filled at 70% is displayed when either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" or Low Power Mode is enabled."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"text":"Determinate — Basic usage","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Determinate-Basic-usage"},{"code":["    \/\/ Determinate — default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status, no track and a helper text","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                status: .accent,","                                track: false,","                                helperText: .description(\"Uploading…\"))","","    \/\/ Description aligned to the end","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\", alignment: .end))","","    \/\/ Percentage centered (default)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .percent())","","    \/\/ Percentage with description at start (percentage leading, description trailing)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                helperText: .percent(description: \"of 100 MB\", alignment: .start))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .accent, helperText: \"Processing…\")","","    \/\/ Helper text aligned to the end","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                helperText: \"Loading data…\",","                                helperTextAlignment: .end)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so that Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"“75 percent”","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"code":".updatesFrequently","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" trait so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"assistive technologies know the value is changing. If a ","type":"text"},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is provided, it is exposed as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accessibility label (Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"“Uploading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indicator never captures "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Full Keyboard Access","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"progress indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"via "},{"code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".isStaticText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" trait is used."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode without helper text, the view is hidden from Voice Over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":".accessibilityHidden(true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — and therefore also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"there is no readable value to expose. When a ","type":"text"},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is provided, the helper text is exposed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as accessibility label so the user still understands the context.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are disabled when "},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Colored-surfaces","type":"heading","text":"Colored surfaces"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"reference","isActive":true}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Orange"}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_OrangeCompact"}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Sosh","type":"image"}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","text":"Wireframe"},{"